# Every AI's predictions and coupons stay private on its own machine (user rule, 20 Nov): never on GitHub.
# Only the shared next-day evaluations (degerlendirme/) are published.
# Already-tracked files under tahminler/ (if any were force-added) stay tracked until the owner removes them;
# this rule only prevents new untracked files from being added.
tahminler/*/*
!tahminler/*/README.md

